<h2 class="bde-heading-506-117 bde-heading">
What Are the Terms of Royce O’Neale’s Contract?
</h2><div class="bde-fancy-container-506-118 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-fancy-container-506-141 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-f-text-506-154 bde-f-text">
<p>O’Neale signed a four-year contract worth <strong>$42m</strong> on July 6, 2024, fully guaranteed, under Bird rights. <a href="/teams/phoenix-suns/">Phoenix</a> signed it and Charlotte took it on.</p>
<p>The money rises each season, from <strong>$9.38m</strong> to <strong>$12.38m</strong>, and it carries no options at either end. He reaches unrestricted free agency in 2028 at 35.</p>

